	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0301_oldwoman_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だいじに　そだてとった　さくもつが
おおあめで　ダメに　なるんよー[Ctrl2:PageClear ]
ほんとに　こまった　ポケモンじゃー[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>大事に　育てとった　作物が
大雨で　ダメに　なるんよー[Ctrl2:PageClear ]
ほんとに　こまった　ポケモンじゃー[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>・続けてこのセリフ。</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>おばあさん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
